flowchart TD
 Start[Launch and load preferences] --> Home[Home dashboard]
 Home --> Notes[Notes tab]
 Notes --> Edit[Rich text editor and attachments]
 Edit --> Save[Autosave or explicit save]
 Save --> Local[Local SQLite and media]
 Home --> Tasks[Tasks and linked notes]
 Tasks --> Due[Due date and priority]
 Due --> Agenda[Schedule calendar and agenda]
 Home --> Settings[Settings and notifications]
 Settings --> Backup[ZIP notes export]
 Backup --> Risk[Restore coverage gaps - see review]
 Home --> Vault[Locked notes and PIN or biometrics]
